  "id": "coping-potential",
  "term": "coping potential",
  "definition": "Coping potential is a person’s appraisal of how much personal control or ability they have to deal with events and actions. In appraisal theories of emotion, this judgment helps shape how positive or negative an emotion is and how strongly it is felt.",
